# DESK14 run B -- the "not an .INF file" path, twice.
#   pass 1: C:\BADSIG.INF starts with "#Z", i.e. it IS a '#' file but not
#           "#R"/"#E".  The pre-DESK14 check (the bare '#') accepted it; the
#           EmuTOS one (deskapp.c:1523-1525) does not -> STINVINF.
#   pass 2: C:\NEWDESK.INF, the 21-byte "newdesk placeholder" the standard card
#           image ships (tools/make-sd-image.sh:54) -> STINVINF as well.  This
#           is the DESK06 control run that was lost to a silent no-op.
# Both alerts are dismissed with Return (the DEFAULT button, EmuTOS fm_keybd).
#   F7NAME (200,310) = BADSIG.INF, F8NAME (200,326) = NEWDESK.INF.
100 parkbr
300 move 600 240
1000 arm
1200 mark A_IDLE
1500 move 196 8
2200 mark B_OPTIONS
2500 move 200 187
2700 down
2703 up
2900 move 600 240
4000 mark C_FSEL
4300 move 260 318
4500 down
4503 up
4700 move 600 240
5300 mark D_PICKED_BADSIG
5600 move 220 401
5800 down
5803 up
6000 move 600 240
6900 mark E_ALERT_BADSIG
7200 key 1c
7250 key 9c
8000 mark F_DISMISSED
8300 move 196 8
9000 mark G_OPTIONS2
9300 move 200 187
9500 down
9503 up
9700 move 600 240
10800 mark H_FSEL2
11100 move 260 326
11300 down
11303 up
11500 move 600 240
12100 mark I_PICKED_PLACEHOLDER
12400 move 220 401
12600 down
12603 up
12800 move 600 240
13700 mark J_ALERT_PLACEHOLDER
14000 key 1c
14050 key 9c
14800 mark K_DISMISSED2
